    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7e60a2cd-07fd-5121-b6b6-b7b21ac58fc6" activityNameId="2324604c-9fd9-5f43-8367-ac82f7400e96" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diesel, burned in cogen 15kWth</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diesel, burned in cogen 15kWth
Inventory for 1 MJ diesel, burned in a cogeneration plant with a capacity of 15 kWth. This inventory reflects the unallocated process of burning natural gas in a cogen unit with all necessary inputs and emissions. Efficiency of the cogen unit as well allocation is not yet considered;
UUID: 272899df-0d4b-326b-888e-29045e0ac114
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (cogeneration plant), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: Average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: Infrastructure extrapolated from 200kWel cogen unit. Some emissions are extrapolated from light fuel oil, burned in boiler &lt;100KW
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_272899df-0d4b-326b-888e-29045e0ac114.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
